<%# locals: (organisations:) %>
<%# The sidebar's middle above the organisations (Belegungstabelle F48; variant C,
    user, 2026-11-14): the lists of the level in one fixed order ("Übersicht", the
    cockpit; "Gesamt-Inbox" and "Personen", the people of all organisations, from
    two active organisations on; a later list of the level is one more row here),
    then every organisation with an active membership
    and its unread count. An organisation row OPENS that organisation (its start
    page: the full page moves the session's organisation, ApplicationController#
    load_tenant_from_session). It never narrows a list and is never marked: the
    inbox narrows through the select field at its list, nowhere else.

    The active row comes from the page's controller (NavigationHelper#level_page_key),
    never from the address: this partial is also drawn by the redraw stream of the
    inbox (all_inboxes/_redraw), whose request is a row action or the live redraw.

    organisations: [{ id:, name:, unread: }] in the order of Organisation.by_name,
    from what the page already loaded (ApplicationController#level_organisations).
    The id is the target of that stream. %>
<% page = level_page_key %>
<div id="all_inboxes_nav" class="w-full px-4 pt-6" data-all-inboxes-nav>
  <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1">
    <%= render 'common/navigation_item', name: t('navigation.overview'), path: select_organisation_path,
                                         icon: 'bi bi-grid', active: page == :overview,
                                         aria_current: ('page' if page == :overview) %>
    <% if organisations.many? %>
      <%= render 'common/navigation_item', name: t('navigation.all_inboxes'), path: all_inboxes_path,
                                           icon: 'bi bi-bell', active: page == :all_inboxes,
                                           aria_current: ('page' if page == :all_inboxes) %>
      <%= render 'common/navigation_item', name: t('navigation.people'), path: all_people_path,
                                           icon: 'bi bi-people', active: page == :all_people,
                                           aria_current: ('page' if page == :all_people) %>
    <% end %>
  </ul>

  <%# Without an active organisation there is nothing to list: no label over an empty list. %>
  <% if organisations.any? %>
    <p class="px-3 pb-1.5 pt-5 section-label text-muted"><%= t('navigation.organisations') %></p>
    <nav aria-label="<%= t('navigation.organisations') %>">
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1">
        <% organisations.each do |organisation| %>
          <%= render 'common/navigation_item',
                name: organisation[:name],
                path: organisation_root_path(organisation_id: organisation[:id]),
                icon: 'bi bi-building',
                count: organisation[:unread] %>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  <% end %>
</div>
